TODO for AptFs
==============

 * Audit return codes on error - EACCES is not really suitable for when a
   package is missing (e.g. stat /path/to/aptfs/no-package-called-this)

 * Disable GPG verification on package download:
   - It's slow
   - GPG employs locking, so AptFs can deadlock (and block other applications)
   - (Could be made optional if using an untrusted mirror)
